- Since no RDKit/packages and compute not required, the design should include a dependency list / install steps (RDKit, etc.) and note that the environment is bare.
- We could do a "sanity" of metric definitions in principle, but no experiment needed.

Statistical design: n seeds, paired comparison; report means ± CI, effect size; hypothesis test (e.g., Wilcoxon signed-rank / permutation) on within-seed deltas.

